Panopticon Connector for WordPress 1.2.2
================================================================================
# [HIGH] Remote plugin/theme installation could fail with a fatal error or "unknown_type" when no other plugin had loaded the WordPress file API [#10]
# [HIGH] Updating a plugin whose activation hook creates database tables failed and left it deactivated [#12]
# [LOW] Plugin and theme update replies could have stray HTML before the JSON data [#12]
# [LOW] Update replies did not say why a plugin could not be re-activated after updating it [#12]

