+ GNU GetText translation support and machine-translated language packs [#7]
# [HIGH] Only the first plugin or theme update in a batch was installed; the rest failed [#8]
# [HIGH] Akeeba Backup integration always received an empty secret word [#9]
# [HIGH] Remote plugin/theme installation failed with "unknown_type" for packages with a top-level folder [#10]

